        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_a_04",
      "hash64": "33860770BD20EDBF",
      "text": "Por cierto, ¿has usado la aplicación Pokédex?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_a_05",
      "hash64": "33860670BD20EC0C",
      "text": "Espero que sí, que para algo la he desarrollado,\\nje.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_a_06",
      "hash64": "33860970BD20F125",
      "text": "Cuando alguien atrapa un Pokémon, la Pokédex\\nse actualiza y yo recibo todos esos datos.\\c\\nNo te puedes ni imaginar lo bien que me vienen\\npara continuar mi investigación.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
